    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029020/extras/cf9ce0cbf09bc47d0d15826952761395.avif?t=1551362132\" /></div><br>Navigate your way through twelve unique levels, using epic power-ups to battle against an array of unique and formidable enemies.  Skill, tactics and strategy will be<br>required to finish each level as fast as you can in order to claim the ultimate prize of a first place score on the worldwide leaderboards.  Do you have what it takes?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br>- Various unlockable power-ups to help overcome an onslaught of attacking enemies.  <br><br>- Unique and powerful enemies to keep you on your toes.  They will beat you in an instant if you are not careful!<br><br>- Four awesome arenas, each with their own unique theme.<br><br>- Four worldwide leaderboards, one for each arena.  Become a master by achieving the highest score in each leaderboard!<br><br>check us out on Instagram :)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029020/extras/0d39186eb28f4c2c3ef6cb998abb7051.avif?t=1551362132\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029020/extras/cf9ce0cbf09bc47d0d15826952761395.avif?t=1551362132\" /></div><br>Navigate your way through twelve unique levels, using epic power-ups to battle against an array of unique and formidable enemies.  Skill, tactics and strategy will be<br>required to finish each level as fast as you can in order to claim the ultimate prize of a first place score on the worldwide leaderboards.  Do you have what it takes?<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br>- Various unlockable power-ups to help overcome an onslaught of attacking enemies.  <br><br>- Unique and powerful enemies to keep you on your toes.  They will beat you in an instant if you are not careful!<br><br>- Four awesome arenas, each with their own unique theme.<br><br>- Four worldwide leaderboards, one for each arena.  Become a master by achieving the highest score in each leaderboard!<br><br>check us out on Instagram :)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029020/extras/0d39186eb28f4c2c3ef6cb998abb7051.avif?t=1551362132\" /></div>",
